```
  ═══ DEV PROFILE (--spring.profiles.active=dev) ═══

  @ConditionalOnProperty(rate-provider=mock)  → MockRateProvider (Recommended) 
  @ConditionalOnProperty(rate-provider=live)  → LiveRateProvider (Avoid) SKIPPED
  @ConditionalOnClass(RedisTemplate)          → RedisCacheService (Avoid) (no Redis jar)
  @ConditionalOnMissingBean(CacheService)     → InMemoryCacheService (Recommended) (fallback)
  @ConditionalOnProperty(fraud-check=true)    → FraudCheckService (Avoid) (=false)

  Beans: MockRateProvider + InMemoryCacheService + no fraud

  ═══ PROD PROFILE (--spring.profiles.active=prod) ═══

  @ConditionalOnProperty(rate-provider=live)  → LiveRateProvider (Recommended) 
  @ConditionalOnProperty(rate-provider=mock)  → MockRateProvider (Avoid) SKIPPED
  @ConditionalOnClass(RedisTemplate)          → RedisCacheService (Recommended) (Redis jar present)
  @ConditionalOnMissingBean(CacheService)     → InMemoryCacheService (Avoid) (Redis exists)
  @ConditionalOnProperty(fraud-check=true)    → FraudCheckService (Recommended) 

  Beans: LiveRateProvider + RedisCacheService + FraudCheckService

  ═══ @SpringBootApplication DECOMPOSITION ═══

  @SpringBootApplication
    = @Configuration              (bean source)
    + @EnableAutoConfiguration    (classpath → auto-config)
    + @ComponentScan              (scan this package)
```

